# FinTrack – Personal Finance Manager

A full-stack personal finance management application built using React.js,
Spring Boot, Spring Security, JWT, and MySQL.

## 🚀 Live Demo

Frontend: https://fintrack-w8em.vercel.app

Backend API: https://fintrack-production-cfb1.up.railway.app/api

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- React.js
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security
- JWT Authentication
- MySQL
- JPA / Hibernate
- Vercel
- Railway

## ✨ Features

- User registration and login
- JWT authentication
- Income and expense tracking
- Budget management
- Dashboard
- Expense charts and reports
- Search transactions
- Edit and delete transactions
- CSV export
